SUMMARY:The Impossible Swim - Documentary Screening Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Screening of the inspiring and heartwarming documentary “The Impossible Swim” (2018) about 16-year old Maya Farrell’s quest to swim across the widest part of Lake Ontario\, to be followed by a panel with one of the film’s directors Larry Weinstein\, as well as the star of the film Maya herself\, and fellow marathon swimmer and Beaches resident Lev Goldberg (first trans person to swim across Lake Ontario)! \nThis event will be a fundraiser for Lev’s 55km Lake Huron swim this August\, which is in support of LGBT Youthline
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/the-impossible-swim-documentary-screening-fundraiser/
LOCATION:Beach United Church\, 140 Wineva Ave.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/23174952/Event-Poster.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Lev Swims Lakes":MAILTO:levswimslakes@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
